{
  "description": "RFC 9111 subset vectors. Time zero is the Date header of the response: Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 GMT. 'store' is whether the response is kept; 'lifetime' its freshness lifetime in seconds; each check asks what the cache does at 'at' seconds after storing, optionally for a request carrying the listed headers. 'sie' asks whether an origin error may be answered with the stale entry.",
